<title>POLAND: Polish NBP buys marks at PLN 1.8800 - dealers.</title>
<headline>Polish NBP buys marks at PLN 1.8800 - dealers.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland (NBP) again bought marks on the interbank market at 1.8800 zlotys, dealers said.</p>
<p>The intervention, described as &quot;medium&quot;, came at 1220 GMT when the zloty was 1.51 percent from the dollar/mark parity rate for today.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
